{"book":"leviticus","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T07:02:51.813174935Z","verse":25,"ref":"leviticus 20:25","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":20,"translation":"And ⟨you⟩ shall distinguish between the clean animal and the unclean, and between the unclean bird and the clean; and ⟨you⟩ shall not make ⟨את⟩ your persons detestable by animal or by bird or by anything that moves on the ground which I have distinguished for you ⟨as⟩ unclean.","tokens":[{"surface":"והבדלתם","gloss":"and you shall distinguish"},{"surface":"בין","gloss":"between"},{"surface":"הבהמה","gloss":"the beast"},{"surface":"הטהרה","gloss":"the clean"},{"surface":"לטמאה","gloss":"and the unclean"},{"surface":"ובין","gloss":"and between"},{"surface":"העוף","gloss":"the bird"},{"surface":"הטמא","gloss":"the unclean"},{"surface":"לטהר","gloss":"and the clean"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"and not"},{"surface":"תשקצו","gloss":"shall make detestable"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"your persons"},{"surface":"נפשתיכם","gloss":"your persons"},{"surface":"בבהמה","gloss":"with the beast"},{"surface":"ובעוף","gloss":"and with the fowl"},{"surface":"ובכל","gloss":"and with everything"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"that"},{"surface":"תרמש","gloss":"creeps"},{"surface":"האדמה","gloss":"on the ground"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"which"},{"surface":"הבדלתי","gloss":"I have distinguished"},{"surface":"לכם","gloss":"for you"},{"surface":"לטמא","gloss":"as unclean"}]}